@startuml Eventora_Sequence_Aktivasi_Pembayaran
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #047857
  ActorBorderColor #059669
  LifeLineBorderColor #059669
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #ECFDF5
  ParticipantBorderColor #059669
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECFDF5
  ParticipantFontColor #1E293B
  BoxBorderColor #059669
  BoxBackgroundColor #F0FDF4
  DividerBackgroundColor #D1FAE5
}
skinparam defaultFontName Inter

title Sequence Diagram — Aktivasi Undangan via Pembayaran Mayar

' ============================================================
'  PARTICIPANTS
' ============================================================

actor "User\n(Browser)" as User
box "Frontend (Next.js)" #F0FDF4
  participant "InvitationsPage\n(/invitations)" as Page <<Client Component>>
end box
box "Backend (Next.js API Routes)" #ECFDF5
  participant "Checkout API\n(/api/checkout)" as CheckoutAPI <<API Route>>
  participant "Webhook API\n(/api/webhook/mayar)" as WebhookAPI <<API Route>>
end box
box "Mayar Payment Gateway" #FFF1F2
  participant "Mayar API\n(api.mayar.id)" as MayarAPI <<External API>>
  participant "Mayar Checkout\nPage" as MayarPage <<External UI>>
end box
box "Supabase" #D1FAE5
  participant "Supabase Server\nClient" as SBServer <<SSR Client>>
  participant "Supabase Service\nRole Client" as SBService <<Service Role>>
  database "PostgreSQL\nDatabase" as DB
end box

' ============================================================
'  FASE 1: CHECKOUT — Membuat Invoice
' ============================================================

== Fase 1: Checkout — Membuat Invoice Pembayaran ==

User -> Page : Klik "Aktifkan" pada\nundangan berstatus Draft
activate Page

Page --> User : ConfirmModal:\n"Aktifkan undangan?\nHarga: Rp XX.000"

User -> Page : Konfirmasi pembayaran

Page -> CheckoutAPI : POST /api/checkout\n{template_id: "emerald-garden"}
activate CheckoutAPI

CheckoutAPI -> SBServer : createServerSupabaseClient()
activate SBServer
SBServer -> SBServer : auth.getUser()
SBServer --> CheckoutAPI : {user: {id, email,\n  user_metadata.full_name}}
deactivate SBServer

CheckoutAPI -> CheckoutAPI : Lookup harga tema:\ntemplates.find(\n  t => t.id === template_id\n)\nprice = template.price

CheckoutAPI -> MayarAPI : POST /hl/v1/invoice/create\nHeaders: {\n  Authorization: Bearer MAYAR_API_KEY\n}\nBody: {\n  name: "Aktivasi Undangan Eventora",\n  amount: 49000,\n  email: user.email,\n  description: "Tema Emerald Garden",\n  expiredAt: ISO (now + 24h)\n}
activate MayarAPI

MayarAPI -> MayarAPI : Buat invoice pembayaran
MayarAPI --> CheckoutAPI : {\n  statusCode: 200,\n  data: {\n    link: "https://mayar.id/pay/xxx",\n    id: "txn_xxx"\n  }\n}
deactivate MayarAPI

CheckoutAPI --> Page : 200 {\n  checkout_url: "https://mayar.id/pay/xxx",\n  transaction_id: "txn_xxx"\n}
deactivate CheckoutAPI

Page --> User : window.open(checkout_url)
deactivate Page

' ============================================================
'  FASE 2: PAYMENT — User Melakukan Pembayaran
' ============================================================

== Fase 2: Payment — Proses Pembayaran di Mayar ==

User -> MayarPage : Buka halaman checkout Mayar
activate MayarPage
MayarPage --> User : Tampilkan metode pembayaran:\n• QRIS\n• Transfer Bank (BCA/BNI/BRI/Mandiri)\n• e-Wallet (OVO/DANA/GoPay)

User -> MayarPage : Pilih metode &\nlakukan pembayaran
MayarPage -> MayarPage : Proses pembayaran
deactivate MayarPage

' ============================================================
'  FASE 3: WEBHOOK — Notifikasi Pembayaran
' ============================================================

== Fase 3: Webhook — Notifikasi Otomatis dari Mayar ==

MayarAPI -> WebhookAPI : POST /api/webhook/mayar\nHeaders: {\n  x-mayar-signature: hmac_sha256\n}\nBody: {\n  event: "payment.success",\n  data: {\n    id: "txn_xxx",\n    status: "paid",\n    amount: 49000,\n    customerEmail: "user@email.com",\n    ...\n  }\n}
activate WebhookAPI

WebhookAPI -> WebhookAPI : verifySignature(\n  payload,\n  signature,\n  MAYAR_WEBHOOK_SECRET\n)\n// crypto.timingSafeEqual(\n//   HMAC-SHA256 comparison\n// )

alt Signature Valid

  WebhookAPI -> SBService : createClient(\n  SUPABASE_URL,\n  SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY\n)
  activate SBService

  WebhookAPI -> DB : UPSERT INTO transactions\n(\n  id: "txn_xxx",\n  user_id: (lookup by email),\n  amount: 49000,\n  status: 'paid',\n  payment_provider: 'mayar',\n  customer_email,\n  paid_at: now(),\n  raw_payload: webhook_body\n)
  activate DB
  DB --> WebhookAPI : Transaction upserted
  deactivate DB

  WebhookAPI -> DB : UPDATE invitations\nSET\n  status = 'active',\n  is_premium = true,\n  activated_at = now()\nWHERE user_id = :user_id\n  AND status = 'draft'
  activate DB
  DB --> WebhookAPI : Invitation activated ✓
  deactivate DB

  deactivate SBService

  WebhookAPI --> MayarAPI : 200 {received: true}

  note over User, DB
    Undangan sekarang berstatus **ACTIVE**
    dan dapat diakses publik via slug URL
  end note

else Signature Invalid
  WebhookAPI --> MayarAPI : 401 Unauthorized\n{error: "Invalid signature"}
end

deactivate WebhookAPI

' ============================================================
'  FASE 4: USER MELIHAT HASIL
' ============================================================

== Fase 4: User Melihat Hasil Aktivasi ==

User -> Page : Refresh /dashboard/invitations
activate Page
Page -> CheckoutAPI : GET /api/invitations
note right: Sebenarnya ke\n/api/invitations\nbukan /api/checkout
CheckoutAPI -> DB : SELECT *, rsvps(count)\nFROM invitations\nWHERE user_id = :user_id
DB --> CheckoutAPI : [invitations with\nupdated status]
CheckoutAPI --> Page : {invitations[]}
Page --> User : Status undangan berubah:\n**"Draft"** → **"Aktif"** ✓
deactivate Page

@enduml
